  fullText: Premou has chosen to transport the foreign object to the recently\ninaugurated
    Prubei laboratory, since it was built in a discrete location.\nI do not understand
    the reasoning for this decision, especially\nconsidering almost no equipment
    has been installed yet.\nAll this secrecy around the object is quite strange.
